# Riverglades (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and schematics whose SOURCE is physically
# in Riverglades for a Horde player, verified against the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever item vendor tables). Thirteen recipes are
# vendor-sold in-zone: the Powderfuse Port (neutral east-hub) vendors
# Fimbo Greasemitz, Gritta Chumwater, Grizzek, Innkeeper Zizplink, Stitch
# Pinwizzle, Kor'gar and Fizzix Boomshot, and the Horde-hub vendor Naluk -
# Naluk is the Horde-only source the Alliance guide excludes. No
# mob-dropped recipe has an in-zone dropper anywhere in the data, so this
# guide is vendor-only. The Alliance-hub vendors Martha Wellsworth and
# Miranda Turner are Alliance-only and excluded (Alterac precedent/EPL
# lesson - see docs/riverglades-horde-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Alchemy, Enchanting, First
# Aid, Fishing, Leatherworking, Tailoring and Blacksmithing have no
# in-zone Horde source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/riverglades-horde-recipes
title Riverglades (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 35-45
zone Riverglades
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords riverglades, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Powderfuse Port vendors - Fimbo's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 2548

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 259962 -- Fimbo Greasemitz (79.02, 54.20), port
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish" npc 259962
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight" npc 259962
  note Miranda Turner at the southern Turner farm sells the same two, but she is Alliance-faction - Fimbo is the Horde-usable source here. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Powderfuse Port vendors - Gritta's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 2548

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 260487 -- Gritta Chumwater (77.42, 52.76), port
  buy 6330 "Recipe: Bristle Whisker Catfish" npc 260487
  buy 6368 "Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore" npc 260487
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

