step Krom'rosh command vendor - Naluk's surprise (Cooking)

  zone map 2548

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 261313 -- Naluk (53.10, 45.85), Horde-hub vendor
  buy 5483 "Recipe: Scorpid Surprise" npc 261313
  note Naluk serves Horde players; the Alliance guide excludes him. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

