step No Horde source - Alchemy
  note Alchemy has no recipe source physically in Riverglades for Horde players in the data - no servable in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

